        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Within Lattice is a 2D logic puzzle game where you swap chunks of tiles in a grid to reach the objective.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4023410/extras/c7bf88183fe3a8b902f2d4ebfa43c23c.poster.avif?t=1761997825\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4023410/extras/c7bf88183fe3a8b902f2d4ebfa43c23c.webm?t=1761997825\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4023410/extras/c7bf88183fe3a8b902f2d4ebfa43c23c.mp4?t=1761997825\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game has over 70 levels that experiment with this swapping mechanic. Each biome presents new challenges, with special tiles that interact with each other in a multitude of ways. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4023410/extras/8daf0953e9ca1cddb6e59a6cb02675b0.poster.avif?t=1761997825\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4023410/extras/8daf0953e9ca1cddb6e59a6cb02675b0.webm?t=1761997825\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4023410/extras/8daf0953e9ca1cddb6e59a6cb02675b0.mp4?t=1761997825\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Can you escape  the lattice?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4023410/extras/1b1538d6d9abde638e6ff07307f6a311.poster.avif?t=1761997825\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4023410/extras/1b1538d6d9abde638e6ff07307f6a311.webm?t=1761997825\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4023410/extras/1b1538d6d9abde638e6ff07307f6a311.mp4?t=1761997825\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Within Lattice is a 2D logic puzzle game where you swap chunks of tiles in a grid to reach the objective.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4023410/extras/c7bf88183fe3a8b902f2d4ebfa43c23c.poster.avif?t=1761997825\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4023410/extras/c7bf88183fe3a8b902f2d4ebfa43c23c.webm?t=1761997825\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4023410/extras/c7bf88183fe3a8b902f2d4ebfa43c23c.mp4?t=1761997825\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game has over 70 levels that experiment with this swapping mechanic. Each biome presents new challenges, with special tiles that interact with each other in a multitude of ways. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4023410/extras/8daf0953e9ca1cddb6e59a6cb02675b0.poster.avif?t=1761997825\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4023410/extras/8daf0953e9ca1cddb6e59a6cb02675b0.webm?t=1761997825\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4023410/extras/8daf0953e9ca1cddb6e59a6cb02675b0.mp4?t=1761997825\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Can you escape  the lattice?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4023410/extras/1b1538d6d9abde638e6ff07307f6a3